<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT- Cypress Semi said cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT- Cypress Semi said cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs cut its rating on Cypress Semiconductor Corp to market outperform from trading buy, a market source said.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Shares were down 1/2 at 11-1/8 on Tuesday morning.</p>
</text>
